  m_Name: Bunny 1
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  npcTalking: Bunny
  _lines:
  - my mother sent me here because i 'hurt" her
  - 'really, i just told her i didnt love her. '
  - i thought honesty was a good trait.
  - if anything, her affection digusts me.
  - she treats me as if i am a doll, uncomfortable with my ever present "self"
  - 'she simply cannot dress my "self" to follow her ideal gestures and throws a
    tantrum, entreating me to be "kind" '
  - im repulsed by the womb i come from, though i know this is abnormal
